[{:db/id "q-36288/selection/05d645eeb327f69f3839b493bf4c16362f19470507ec379b5ea807bb75590a80" :answer/id #uuid "17022fb1-5112-5533-b749-04a65ab35462" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbola: $\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=-1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36288/selection/7f5a42b1e0fb38718f3916aef712f9b5ab97796444ad4304663deb61ef8c88a6" :answer/id #uuid "e13efd66-9868-589e-8498-1c76c8371f95" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Two parallel lines: $z=2x\\pm 4$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36288/selection/353cb9a5dcf54da4b6e9347e32820855e7a7b0ce2a73d90172919af9db06f231" :answer/id #uuid "35224d72-9991-5312-8440-3ce5a67e73db" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbola: $-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16}=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36288/selection/6ccc2a6af7497df45f3257fda1d2aeaf4cb23355f481f2fb53c647197d29b9b9" :answer/id #uuid "e07785da-bacd-5924-8019-b3061461d6f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "A hyperbola: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36288/selection/e4842371f7cf1df3116b5dc018dfae34e7f1eac16344c3c3f8c0cbb2a0ba2f6d" :answer/id #uuid "03f0c68d-996e-5d85-bc53-4c76a24ac8ca" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "An ellipse: $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=1$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36288/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc0ff648-0b9b-5d68-8989-082d8d1ac7e7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-36288/selection/353cb9a5dcf54da4b6e9347e32820855e7a7b0ce2a73d90172919af9db06f231" :answer-field/choices ["q-36288/selection/05d645eeb327f69f3839b493bf4c16362f19470507ec379b5ea807bb75590a80" "q-36288/selection/7f5a42b1e0fb38718f3916aef712f9b5ab97796444ad4304663deb61ef8c88a6" "q-36288/selection/353cb9a5dcf54da4b6e9347e32820855e7a7b0ce2a73d90172919af9db06f231" "q-36288/selection/6ccc2a6af7497df45f3257fda1d2aeaf4cb23355f481f2fb53c647197d29b9b9" "q-36288/selection/e4842371f7cf1df3116b5dc018dfae34e7f1eac16344c3c3f8c0cbb2a0ba2f6d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-36288" :question/id #uuid "fcfedd1b-1d6b-51cf-8ffc-3860006da14a" :question/math-academy-id "q-36288" :question/problem "What is the projection of the intersection between the hyperboloid of two sheets $\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8}=-1$ and the plane $y=2$ onto the $xz$-plane?" :question/worked-solution "To find the intersection of the hyperboloid and the plane $y=2$, we substitute $y=2$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{(2)^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}+1-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{8} & =-2 \\\\ -\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we get the hyperbola: $-\\frac{(x-2)^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{16}=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-36288/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d28eda1a-a90b-57e9-969a-eb36552e413e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-36288"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388/selection/0188b4725c10757d3715b0c56024f20821f1679ef0358891a4d1473774fc01fb" :answer/id #uuid "8691b817-07e3-5444-963c-feb3658f53ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}<1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388/selection/037fb834278b910823c9ef61f0f4b6409701e2031a8dedabb3aaf3077f91b312" :answer/id #uuid "37038554-0809-5cbd-b086-1402bddf9a27" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The entire $xy$-plane" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388/selection/d9f5aae64c48ecc453e7d7d49ca8ae01b27c92888852dd67cc7177976786c663" :answer/id #uuid "b2c0d0cc-0db3-547e-adfa-51a99a2e3514" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}\\ge 1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388/selection/2637b4ac7ce39bc1fb44d70f2692527b58eaa020d4421446916b02802bef784d" :answer/id #uuid "30303328-08ed-5e01-ad90-cc263ebd3f1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}\\ge 0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388/selection/7648bd1e9786c02a2cf8cc2626f3c4c75eefa05b681e9b690c7501b99eb961c3" :answer/id #uuid "2e96d36e-9083-5c65-a480-de9f7f1c813c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}<0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f7af6c87-f1c4-563d-815c-c1b791f2019a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-36388/selection/d9f5aae64c48ecc453e7d7d49ca8ae01b27c92888852dd67cc7177976786c663" :answer-field/choices ["q-36388/selection/0188b4725c10757d3715b0c56024f20821f1679ef0358891a4d1473774fc01fb" "q-36388/selection/037fb834278b910823c9ef61f0f4b6409701e2031a8dedabb3aaf3077f91b312" "q-36388/selection/d9f5aae64c48ecc453e7d7d49ca8ae01b27c92888852dd67cc7177976786c663" "q-36388/selection/2637b4ac7ce39bc1fb44d70f2692527b58eaa020d4421446916b02802bef784d" "q-36388/selection/7648bd1e9786c02a2cf8cc2626f3c4c75eefa05b681e9b690c7501b99eb961c3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-36388" :question/id #uuid "a512bde0-1c66-51f2-af4c-d779890eea15" :question/math-academy-id "q-36388" :question/problem "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet  $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{3}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" :question/worked-solution "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{3} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1 & =\\frac{(z+1)^{2}}{3} \\\\ (z+1)^{2} & =3(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1) \\\\ (z+1) & =\\pm \\sqrt{3(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}=1$, including its boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{6}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}\\ge 1}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-36388/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b079a5ff-e73a-592f-b16c-8740682538f3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-36388"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-36465"] :question/problem "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet $(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" :question/worked-solution "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9} & =1 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1 & =\\frac{{z}^{2}}{9}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2} & =9((x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1) \\\\ z & =\\pm 3\\sqrt{(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ (x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1,$ which includes the boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,(x-2)^{2}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}\\ge 1}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859/selection/b071e68b1612a1c3675dead18dfc59af2b3f21bbd0d992c7f5448250f8db1c2b" :answer/id #uuid "28cddf47-44dd-57e1-822b-eda59ead2fca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}\\ge 1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859/selection/18a918da11c06635d3e629248958dd0da0e4ce1b1fa84a70cf5778dfc49c3a47" :answer/id #uuid "c191664c-91e5-544b-a9e5-6fdfe461401f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}>0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859/selection/650161d9de966915a5551794b515dcdd8673f4f039e082566f5f9061c113b66f" :answer/id #uuid "1ac83b4a-6053-5c4c-9a91-3703a3df9d97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}<0}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859/selection/e7d75ac7903e862b63df02d676fe2f15cf6d42405c861a53540bf0a44ebe9467" :answer/id #uuid "62875bf8-d496-51b2-8e61-1e96fcce1e92" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}\\le 1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859/selection/5d7d3a97072dde0560b7021c04299ad3846090c436eb944924a71aaeb46b7d5a" :answer/id #uuid "b4d98915-83c5-59e4-be75-f686b94c8be4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}<1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "11eb0e8f-a65c-581e-badb-321a66b262d2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71859/selection/b071e68b1612a1c3675dead18dfc59af2b3f21bbd0d992c7f5448250f8db1c2b" :answer-field/choices ["q-71859/selection/b071e68b1612a1c3675dead18dfc59af2b3f21bbd0d992c7f5448250f8db1c2b" "q-71859/selection/18a918da11c06635d3e629248958dd0da0e4ce1b1fa84a70cf5778dfc49c3a47" "q-71859/selection/650161d9de966915a5551794b515dcdd8673f4f039e082566f5f9061c113b66f" "q-71859/selection/e7d75ac7903e862b63df02d676fe2f15cf6d42405c861a53540bf0a44ebe9467" "q-71859/selection/5d7d3a97072dde0560b7021c04299ad3846090c436eb944924a71aaeb46b7d5a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71859" :question/id #uuid "73e903d1-edee-53d5-8ed7-40e859ad5358" :question/math-academy-id "q-71859" :question/problem "Given the hyperboloid of one sheet  $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{5}=1$, find the domain of $z=z(x,y).$" :question/worked-solution "From the hyperboloid equation, we make $z$ the subject as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{5} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1 & =\\frac{(z-1)^{2}}{5} \\\\ (z-1)^{2} & =5(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1) \\\\ (z-1) & =\\pm \\sqrt{5(\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nSince the square root is defined only for non-negative arguments, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}-1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8} & \\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives the exterior of the ellipse $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}=1$, including its boundary.\n\nTherefore, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\,:\\,\\frac{{x}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{(y-2)^{2}}{8}\\ge 1}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-71859/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b079a5ff-e73a-592f-b16c-8740682538f3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71859"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957/selection/440117db4408e0e9769409a442a09beb0251090a06cc02c4f7603d14bb807a1b" :answer/id #uuid "2bbebbfe-b0f8-5feb-a153-4832182fdebb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957/selection/fcf21bb97c6598bd9b3d7d77610c545350a0a733015e3f132e01d54792082804" :answer/id #uuid "e1fbb8e0-aac9-5015-8e1c-ad4db880774d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957/selection/54f9eb1316b249002762108169e0dff04eb1d069ef12febecff574cd1ab779db" :answer/id #uuid "ee4ef2dd-79aa-5479-b296-541bf3ed7b75" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-4{y}^{2}=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957/selection/b53721c4cf525a25f4de4fbee5a70aa1db24fe0c026eb5c5e91af8af98ece50a" :answer/id #uuid "0c8b766a-babc-5b2d-a8a2-ad1f4e8b1626" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957/selection/365e17ab0ef399d0a951b1be8d4dd69763238e7a75d336626ea0f82d31c79b7b" :answer/id #uuid "d554a209-7d90-5fa4-98ea-eea2ff7171da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "17fbbdb2-c84f-59dd-89b4-d740a4678f39" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71957/selection/b53721c4cf525a25f4de4fbee5a70aa1db24fe0c026eb5c5e91af8af98ece50a" :answer-field/choices ["q-71957/selection/440117db4408e0e9769409a442a09beb0251090a06cc02c4f7603d14bb807a1b" "q-71957/selection/fcf21bb97c6598bd9b3d7d77610c545350a0a733015e3f132e01d54792082804" "q-71957/selection/54f9eb1316b249002762108169e0dff04eb1d069ef12febecff574cd1ab779db" "q-71957/selection/b53721c4cf525a25f4de4fbee5a70aa1db24fe0c026eb5c5e91af8af98ece50a" "q-71957/selection/365e17ab0ef399d0a951b1be8d4dd69763238e7a75d336626ea0f82d31c79b7b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71957" :question/id #uuid "d349238c-6c2f-5255-bd28-dab6727e3a56" :question/math-academy-id "q-71957" :question/problem "What is the trace in the $xy$-plane of the hyperboloid of one sheet $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{6}=1?$" :question/worked-solution "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{0}^{2}}{6}=1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}=1 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola in $xy$-plane." :